---
import Policy from '../Policy.astro';
import { COURTS, FIRM } from '../site';
const sections = [
  { h: 'Who we are', p: [
    `FinSight is run by ${FIRM.name}, ${FIRM.kind}. By using this site you agree to these terms; if you do not, please do not use it.`,
  ] },
  { h: 'What the tools do', p: [
    'The tools work out DSCR statements, CMA data, construction estimates and project reports from the figures you type, using rules and rates from public sources, each shown with its source and date. They are free to use today.',
  ] },
  { h: 'Your part', p: [
    'You are responsible for the figures you type and for what you hand to a lender. Check every document before you sign it or hand it over.',
    'Do not use the tools to make a false document, to mislead a lender or to break the law. Do not try to break, overload or copy the site in bulk.',
  ] },
  { h: 'Figures, not advice', p: [
    'The results are worked out from your figures, not advice, and they do not mean a loan will be sanctioned: each lender decides by its own rules. [Not advice](/not-advice/) says more.',
  ] },
  { h: 'What belongs to whom', p: [
    'The documents you make are yours to print, keep and share. The site’s design, words and code belong to FinSight. Brand names shown in the estimate belong to their owners.',
  ] },
  { h: 'The limits of our responsibility', p: [
    'We take care that the figures are right and test them against worked examples. Even so, the tools are given as they are, and so far as the law allows we are not responsible for a loss that comes from relying on them.',
  ] },
  { h: 'If something goes wrong', p: [
    `Write to us first, through the [Contact](/contact/) page. These terms follow the laws of India, and the courts at ${COURTS}, decide any dispute.`,
    'We may change these terms; the date at the top shows when they last changed. Using the site after a change means you accept it.',
  ] },
];
---
<Policy title="Terms of use" description="The terms for using FinSight's tools and the documents they make." lead="The terms for using FinSight’s tools and the documents they make." sections={sections} />
